# text = There , I confess , His Honour the Mayor is too many for me even a diplomatic bird must fall to such a gun But I crave pardon His Honour the Mayor will bear with me , if for a moment I have been deluded into occupying his time , and have forgotten the humble claims upon my own , of my hotel , the Crozier Not at all , sir I am returning home , and if you would like to take the exterior of our Cathedral in your way , I shall be glad to point it out His Honour the Mayor is more than kind and gracious Might I ask His Honour whether that gentleman we have just left is the gentleman of whom I have heard in the neighbourhood as being much afflicted by the loss of a nephew , and concentrating his life on avenging the loss
