# text = We dined very well indeed thank you Accustomed my good woman accustomed to a liberal and nutritious , yet plain and salutary diet , we have found no reason to bemoan our absence from the ancient city , and the methodical household , in which the quiet routine of our lot has been hitherto cast I did think it well to mention to my cook which I ' ope you will agree with , Miss Twinkleton , was a right precaution , that the young lady being used to what we should consider here but poor diet , had better be brought forward by degrees .
